# Synthetic fixtures only — no vendor payload may ever land here.
#
# The repo root .gitignore excludes *.bin but not *.fw, and this family ships
# as .fw. That root file is outside this work's write scope, so the exclusion
# is made local instead: nothing under this directory is tracked.
#
# Regenerate at any time with:
#     python3 -I make_fixture.py
*
!.gitignore
